        <p class="rate-index-desc">
          Official ground-reality per-Marla transaction rates across Tehsil Chichawatni (Premier Residential Colonies, Commercial Highway Corridors & Key Agro-Industrial Sectors). Audited and verified via official PLRA land records.
        </p>
